%%{init: {'fontFamily':'Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Environment and token file
    participant C as Client
    participant F as FastAPI app
    participant G as get_api_key
    participant H as Route handler
    participant V as validate_ingress_api_key
    participant Y as Config file

    Note over S,F: Startup loads the main API keys once
    S->>F: CONSERVER_API_TOKEN, one key
    S->>F: CONSERVER_API_TOKEN_FILE, one key per line
    F->>F: Build the api_keys list

    Note over C,H: Public routes sit on app and check no key
    C->>F: GET /version, /health or /stats/queue
    F->>H: Call the handler
    H-->>C: Route response

    Note over C,H: Main API routes sit on api_router
    C->>F: Request with key in CONSERVER_HEADER_NAME
    F->>G: Run the Security dependency
    alt api_keys is empty
        G-->>F: Skip the check, return None
    else Header value is in api_keys
        G-->>F: Return the key
    else Key missing or not in api_keys
        G-->>C: 403 Invalid API Key
    end
    F->>H: Call the handler after a pass
    H-->>C: Route response

    Note over C,Y: External ingress sits on external_router and ignores api_keys
    C->>F: POST /vcon/external-ingress?ingress_list=name
    F->>F: Validate the query and the Vcon body
    opt Query or body is invalid
        F-->>C: 422 before any key check
    end
    F->>H: Call external_ingress_vcon
    H->>V: Pass ingress_list and the header value
    alt No header value
        V-->>C: 403 API Key required
    else Header value present
        V->>Y: Read ingress_auth on every request
        Y-->>V: Map of ingress list to allowed keys
        alt ingress_auth is empty
            V-->>C: 403 No ingress authentication configured
        else ingress_list is not in the map
            V-->>C: 403 Ingress list not configured
        else Map value is neither string nor list
            V-->>C: 403 Invalid configuration
        else Key is not allowed for this list
            V-->>C: 403 Invalid API Key for ingress list
        else Key is allowed for this list
            V-->>H: Return the key
            H-->>C: 204 after store and enqueue, 500 on failure
        end
    end
